=[ Tomet Shelf ]

Fast static site generator and documentation server specifically built for Tomet (`.tmt`) vaults.

==[ Overview ]

`tomet-shelf` provides a modern documentation site experience for Tomet vaults. It features:
-| **Blazing fast builds**: Written in Rust, optimized for large-scale knowledge bases.
-| **Instant link resolution**: First-class support for Tomet intra-vault link resolution and references.
-| **Client-side search**: Full-text client-side indexing and instant search interface.
-| **Live reloading development server**: Fast feedback cycle during documentation authoring.

==[ Workspace Layout ]

-| @dir(app) (`tomet-shelf-cli`) -- CLI binary (`tomet-shelf`).
-| @dir(crates/tomet-shelf-assets) (`tomet-shelf-assets`) -- Official frontend web assets, Askama templates, theme styling, client scripts, and i18n dictionaries.
-| @dir(crates/tomet-shelf-headless) (`tomet-shelf-headless`) -- Headless SSG engine, vault state, and dev server orchestration.
-| @dir(crates/tomet-shelf-headless-config) (`tomet-shelf-config`) -- `shelf.toml` configuration parser and models.
-| @dir(crates/tomet-shelf-headless-document) (`tomet-shelf-document`) -- Tomet document parsing, AST transformation, and metadata extraction.
-| @dir(crates/tomet-shelf-headless-route) (`tomet-shelf-route`) -- Route resolution, slug generation, and URL sanitization.
-| @dir(crates/tomet-shelf-headless-search) (`tomet-shelf-search`) -- Full-text search indexing.
-| @dir(crates/tomet-shelf-headless-serve) (`tomet-shelf-serve`) -- Axum development server and WebSocket live reload.

==[ Building and Running ]

=== Build workspace
```bash
cargo build --workspace
```

=== Run tests
```bash
cargo test --workspace
```

=== Serve a vault locally
```bash
cargo run -p tomet-shelf-cli -- serve tmtroot/
```
